<title>UK: London precious metals close mixed; PGMs volatile.</title>
<headline>London precious metals close mixed; PGMs volatile.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $343.80/$344.30 down a dollar. No impact from Bundesbank-Bonn row over reserves. Stronger dollar largely negative. Still rangebound.</p>
<p>SILVER - Quiet and ended up six cents at $4.77/$4.79.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finished at $409.00/$413.00 vs $401.20/$402.20.</p>
<p>Extremely tight, volatile.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Off about $7.00 at $188.50/$192.50.</p>
</text>
